{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/330707-new-from-dean-shomshak-shared-origins-the-dynatron","id":330707,"title":"New from Dean Shomshak: SHARED ORIGINS: THE DYNATRON","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-04T19:11:45-08:00","id":330707,"title":"New from Dean Shomshak: SHARED ORIGINS: THE DYNATRON","content":"People who've enjoyed my work on Vampire, Exalted, Scion and other games might be interested in my latest product, SHARED ORIGINS: THE DYNATRON. It's part of my continuing effort to bring a more WW/OP sensibility to Champions. It's now available through Hero Games.<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://www.herogames.com/forums/store/product/500-shared-origins-the-dynatron/\" target=\"_blank\">Power For Sale</a></b><br /> <br /> A billion dollars, legal immunity, and a Nobel Prize. That\u2019s the supervillain Red Giant\u2019s price to reveal the secret of the Dynatron \u2014 his miracle machine that can give anyone super-powers. Nobody\u2019s met his price\u2026 yet.<br /> <br /> For a mere half-million, you can step into the Dynatron and receive super-powers yourself. Lots of people take this offer: Gangs and governments who want super-thugs and super-soldiers; would-be villains in search of origins; established supervillains hoping for power-ups. Won\u2019t you join the list of satisfied customers?<br /> <br /> Here\u2019s what you get in the 47-page supplement Shared Origins: The Dynatron:<br /> <br /> * Background and game mechanics for the Dynatron \u2014 the Instant Origin Machine!<br /> <br /> * Nine sample villains who gained their powers from the Dynatron, from the out-of-his-depth Mob enforcer Orb to the city-freezing Fimbulwinter. Each character comes with a complete character sheet, background, story seeds, and a full-color illustration.<br /> <br /> * One sample hero, ready to play or use as an NPC.<br /> <br /> * The story of how Red Giant invented the Dynatron, and the consequences for him and his first supervillain team, the Rainbow Cartel.<br /> <br /> * A brief discussion of \u201cPower Vendors\u201d as reusable sources of super-powered characters, with four additional examples of this origin story.<br /> <br /> * A look at the practical difficulties of selling super-powers and owning the most valuable machine in the world.<br /> <br /> Uses HERO System 6th Edition or CHAMPIONS Complete.<br /> <br /> <b>THE SHARED ORIGINS SERIES</b><br /> <br /> This series of mini-supplements for CHAMPIONS provides &quot;Origin Stories&quot; that players and GMs can use for many different characters. Coming up with character origins is work; reusable origin gimmicks help you spend more time on character backgrounds and motivations and less time explaining why heroes and villains have super-powers in the first place. Shared origins can also tie characters together and create story hooks.<br /> <br /> Each supplement supplies background information and game mechanics for one shared origin story, a ready-to-play sample hero, and a selection of sample villains. Supplements stand alone to make it easier to plug the sample characters and origin story into your own superhero setting.<br /> ----------------<br /> Dean Shomshak","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1175-dshomshak","name":"DShomshak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"197"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-19T01:46:32-08:00","id":375022,"title":"","content":"Hmm...My supers game of choice is Mutants and Masterminds, but considering my players recently made an enemy of Marvel's Power Broker, this might be a good read anyway...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}